; Edge cases for multi-commodity parsing. Not meant for hledger itself.
P 2026-01-10 BTC €40000
commodity 1,000.00 "AAPL 2024"
commodity 0.00000000 BTC

2026-01-02 Quoted commodity with total cost
    assets:broker      10 "AAPL 2024" @@ $1,500.00
    assets:cash        $-1,500.00

2026-01-03 Total cost in euro
    assets:crypto      0.5 BTC @@ €20000
    assets:cash        €-20000

2026-01-04 Orphan commodity, no price path
    assets:misc        100 XYZ
    equity:open

2026-01-05 Three commodities (must not infer a price)
    assets:a           €10
    assets:b           $12
    assets:c           £-8

2026-01-06 Blank posting over two commodities
    expenses:mix       €5
    expenses:mix       $7
    assets:cash

2026-01-07 Same sign pair (must not infer a price)
    assets:d           €5
    assets:e           $5
